  "All information is held in confidence and used only to assess fit.": "所有資訊皆以機密處理，僅用於評估適配程度。",
  "All rights reserved.": "版權所有。",
  "An IAL recognition for adult educators with deep specialist skill. Written IAL-SAE where the institute confers it.": "IAL 頒予具備深厚專科技能之成人教育工作者的一項認可。於該學院授予時寫作 IAL-SAE。",
  "An advanced credential for curriculum developers and adult educators, above ACTA and ACLP.": "一項供課程開發人員與成人教育工作者取得、層級高於 ACTA 與 ACLP 的高階資歷。",
  "An annual campaign plan": "一份年度行銷活動計劃",
  "An arch holds quietly because every stone is set in its right place. A community of practitioners works the same way, matched to the project, no more, no less.": "一道拱門之所以靜穩屹立，是因每一塊石頭都安放於其恰當之處。實務工作者的社群亦如是運作，恰與專案相配，不多，也不少。",
  "An eligibility check is run at enquiry, a course-fit conversation is held before any deposit is taken, and a thirty-day post-course check-in is tied to the trainer's continuing development. Every conversation is logged. The same script handles both pre and post.": "於查詢時進行資格查核，在收取任何訂金之前先行洽談課程適配度，並將課後三十天的追蹤關懷與培訓師的持續發展相繫。每一次洽談皆有記錄。同一套腳本同時處理課前與課後。",
  "An onboarded directory of trainers carries credentials, course matches, observation records and continuing professional development. It is renewed annually, audited at every TPQA, and prepared before every cohort.": "一份已完成登錄的培訓師名冊，載有資歷、課程配對、觀課紀錄，以及持續專業發展。它每年更新、在每一次 TPQA 中接受稽核，並在每一屆班次開課前備妥。",
  "And the Rules of Evidence, applied to the actual assessment instruments in use, not the ones submitted at approval.": "以及證據規則，套用於實際使用中的評量工具，而非審批時提交的那些。",
  "And the line is no longer only a rule of conduct. The TPQA item covering the management of marketing activities was updated with effect from 1 December 2025, which means your marketing governance, claim substantiation and publishing discipline are now read at audit alongside your courseware. Marketing built carelessly is no longer merely ineffective; it is an audit finding waiting to be written.": "而這條界線，已不再僅是一項行為準則。TPQA 中關於行銷活動管理的項目，自 2025 年 12 月 1 日起更新生效，這意味著您的行銷治理、宣稱佐證與發佈紀律，如今在稽核時會與您的課程教材一併受審。草率建構的行銷，已不再只是徒勞無功；它是一項正等著被寫下的稽核發現。",
  "And the next mandate": "以及下一份委託",
  "Any organisation that wants to offer SWDA-funded courses for the first time must pass through Organisation Registration (OR) on TPGateway, and the application is reviewed together with a first Course Application (CA). The two stand or fall as a pair, which is why we always prepare them on the same working schedule.": "任何機構若欲首次開辦 SWDA 資助的課程，都必須通過 TPGateway 上的機構註冊（OR），而該申請會與首份課程申請（CA）一併審核。兩者共存亡、同進退，這正是我們始終將它們安排於同一工作時程上準備的原因。",
  "Application via TPGateway": "透過 TPGateway 提交申請",
