  "Based on the circular published (SSG Information Memorandum QMD/2025/5), from 1 December 2025 onwards, SWDA will disallow RTPs from engaging, requesting or procuring any third party to promote, advertise or market courses. We work together with our clients and prospects to develop in-house strategies for marketing outreach.": "根據所公佈的通函（SSG 資訊備忘錄 QMD/2025/5），自 2025 年 12 月 1 日起，SWDA 將禁止 RTP 聘用、要求或委辦任何第三方推廣、宣傳或行銷課程。我們與客戶及潛在客戶攜手，發展內部的行銷推廣策略。",
  "Beautifully illustrated throughout.": "從頭到尾配圖精美。",
  "Because CQC reviews the materials a training provider is actually delivering, the work cannot wait until a notification from SWDA arrives. We support training providers across the CQC lifecycle in five ways.": "由於 CQC 審查的是培訓機構實際交付的教材，這項工作不能等到 SWDA 的通知到來才著手。我們以五種方式，在 CQC 的整個週期中支援培訓機構。",
  "Becoming an SWDA-registered training provider takes months of paperwork, and running one takes discipline every week after. We manage the registration, develop your first course, and run the administration for as long as you need us.": "成為 SWDA 註冊培訓機構，需要數月的文書作業；而營運一家培訓機構，此後每一週都需要紀律。我們代為處理註冊、開發您的第一門課程，並在您需要我們的期間持續執行行政事務。",
  "Becoming an approved provider": "成為認可培訓機構",
  "Before any curriculum is developed, the course has to qualify for support. SWDA funds a Tier 2 course through one of two routes, and we advise on the right one at scoping. Current as at 1 July 2026.": "在任何課程開發之前，課程必須符合資助資格。SWDA 透過兩條途徑之一資助第二層級課程，我們會在界定範圍時就合適的一條提供建議。資訊截至 2026 年 7 月 1 日。",
  "Before the date is set": "在日期確定之前",
