  "Both": "兩者皆可",
  "Both are manageable, and neither should be frightening, provided the preparation starts early. That preparation is exactly what this service provides.": "兩者皆可駕馭，只要及早著手準備，便都無需畏懼。而這份準備，正是本服務所提供的。",
  "Both routes lead to Tier 2 funding, subject to an enrolment cap of 200 places for face-to-face delivery or 350 places online. On reaching the cap, SWDA runs two checks before the funding is renewed.": "兩條途徑皆可通往第二層級資助，惟受招生名額上限所限：面授為 200 個名額，線上為 350 個名額。一旦達到上限，SWDA 會在資助續期之前進行兩項查核。",
  "Brand": "品牌",
  "Brand consistency and claim substantiation. Reduces the marginal cost of acquiring each learner and protects against misrepresentation complaints.": "品牌的一致性與宣稱佐證。降低招收每一位學員的邊際成本，並防範不實陳述的投訴。",
