  "Draw them a small map.": "給他畫一張小地圖。",
  "Dream big.": "勇於築夢。",
  "Dream big. Aim far.": "勇於築夢，志向高遠。",
  "ECI": "ECI",
  "ESG": "ESG",
  "ESG fundamentals, decarbonisation, climate-related disclosures.": "ESG 基礎、脫碳，以及氣候相關披露。",
  "Each AE who trains or assesses must hold the WSQ Advanced Certificate in Training and Assessment, the WSQ Advanced Certificate in Learning and Performance (ACLP 2.0), or an equivalent recognised by SWDA at its sole discretion.": "每一位授課或評量的 AE，都必須持有 WSQ 培訓與評估高級證書、WSQ 學習與績效高級證書（ACLP 2.0），或經 SWDA 全權裁量所認可的同等資歷。",
  "Each criterion is also a return on investment.": "每一項準則，同時也是一份投資回報。",
  "Each cycle carries a plan reviewed quarterly, a do tracked in operations, a check at month-end, and an act recorded as a corrective action that is closed at the next review. The cycle is visible at every level of the operation.": "每一個循環都包含：每季檢視的規劃、在營運中追蹤的執行、於月底進行的查核，以及記錄為修正措施、並在下次檢視時結案的行動。這個循環在營運的每一個層級都清晰可見。",
  "Each engagement is scoped precisely, priced in writing before work begins, and finished the way it was promised.": "每一項委聘皆經精準界定範圍，並於工作展開前以書面訂明費用，最終按承諾如實交付。",
  "Each form has its own route through TPGateway. We prepare a complete and accurate submission, then stay on hand for SWDA's clarifications until the review is closed.": "每一種形式在 TPGateway 上都有其專屬途徑。我們會準備一份完整而準確的提交，然後隨時待命回應 SWDA 的釐清要求，直至審查結案。",
  "Each is an organisation we have worked in, developed for, sat with, or supplied with a developer, an adult educator or a subject-matter expert.": "每一家皆是我們曾任職、曾為其開發、曾與其共事，或曾為其供應開發人員、成人教育工作者或主題專家的機構。",
  "Each project is led by a Level 3 Senior Professional Adult Educator under TAEPP, supported by two curriculum developers accredited under DACE or DDDLP, and by three where the project calls for it. We do not subcontract, and we are glad to introduce you to the people who will be handling your project.": "每個專案均由一位 TAEPP 認證的第三級資深專業成人教育工作者主理，並有兩位依 DACE 或 DDDLP 認證的課程開發人員從旁協助，必要時增至三位。我們不外判工作，亦樂於為您引見實際負責您專案的團隊成員。",
  "Early Childhood": "幼兒教育",
