  "Endorsed by the Institute for Human Resource Professionals (IHRP), awarding Skills Badges in Fair and Progressive Practices": "由 Institute for Human Resource Professionals (IHRP) 認可，於公平與進步實務方面頒發技能徽章",
  "Energy and Chemicals": "能源與化工",
  "Energy and Power": "能源與電力",
  "Engage 2birds on the full OR application": "委聘 2birds 處理完整的 OR 申請",
  "Engaging 2birds is not a way to outsource regulatory accountability. Under the SWDA framework, the obligation to deliver quality training rests, at all times, with the Registered Training Provider. Our work is advisory, and it is intended to leave the training provider better governed than we found it. It falls into four pillars.": "委聘 2birds 並非將監管責任外包的途徑。在 SWDA 框架下，交付優質培訓的義務，始終落在註冊培訓機構身上。我們的工作屬顧問性質，旨在讓培訓機構在我們接手後，比先前治理得更為完善。此工作可分為四大支柱。",
  "Engineering Services": "工程服務",
  "English": "英文",
  "Enterprise risk, compliance, controls and audit readiness.": "企業風險、合規、內控與稽核準備。",
  "Environmental Services": "環境服務",
  "Environmental, Social and Governance": "環境、社會與管治",
  "Equivalence": "同等資歷",
  "Equivalent pathways": "同等資歷途徑",
  "Establishing a new ATO": "設立全新的 ATO",
  "Estimated Chargeable Income": "預估應課稅收入",
  "Every abbreviation,": "每一個縮寫，",
  "Every abbreviation,spelt out.": "每一個縮寫，逐一詳解。",
  "Every artefact carries a version line and change log, and every assessment traces back to the competency map, and from there to the approved Course Application. This is what the Course Quality Check reads for, and what holds a programme together long after the first cohort. Where a project calls for it, marketing collateral is included at no extra charge.": "每一件工件都帶有版本註記與變更紀錄，每一項評量都能回溯至能力對照表，並自該處回溯至已審批的課程申請。這正是課程品質查核所要審視的，也是首屆班次過後仍將一門課程緊繫在一起的關鍵。若專案有此需要，行銷素材亦一併納入，不另收費。",
  "Every commission is shaped to the provider, but these are the pieces we are most often asked to make. Each sits, by design, on the permitted side of the guideline.": "每一份委託都因應各培訓機構量身打造，但以下是我們最常獲邀製作的作品。每一件都刻意落在指引所允許的一側。",
  "Every course begins with someone who wants more.": "每一門課程，都始於一位渴望更多的人。",
  "Every engagement covers the complete set, developed in-house by our own developers and built to satisfy SWDA's approval standards.": "每一項委聘皆涵蓋完整的一整套，由我們自己的開發人員內部編製，並以滿足 SWDA 審批標準為目標而建構。",
  "Every engagement is priced as a fixed fee, set out in a written proposal before any work begins. The fee reflects the standard of the work, from accredited developers to two readers on every page, and a firm that stays with the course through approval and audit. We would rather do fewer projects properly than many projects cheaply, and our clients tend to feel the same way.": "每一項委聘均以固定費用計價，並於任何工作展開前載明於書面建議書之中。費用反映工作的水準：從認證開發人員，到每一頁均經兩人審閱，以至一家自課程審批到稽核始終相伴的公司。我們寧願用心做好較少的專案，也不願廉價承接大量專案，而我們的客戶往往深有同感。",
  "Every funded course in Singapore takes one of three routes, each asking for different evidence. Choosing the right one is the first decision, and we make it with you before development begins.": "Singapore 每一門獲資助的課程，都循三條途徑之一，各自要求不同的佐證。選對途徑是第一項決定，而我們會在開發開始之前，與您一同作出。",
  "Every training provider should be able to reach the standard SWDA asks for, whatever its budget. When a provider meets that standard, the learners are the ones who gain, because the training they receive is at its best. Helping providers get there, for the sake of every learner in the room, is why the first stretch of our audit advisory is offered pro bono.": "無論預算多寡，每一家培訓機構都應能達到 SWDA 所要求的標準。當一家機構達到該標準，受益的正是學員，因為他們所接受的培訓臻於至善。為了教室裡的每一位學員，協助機構抵達那個標準，正是我們稽核顧問服務的第一段路程以無償方式提供的原因。",
  "Examinable courses with clear learning outcomes, built for employment or upgrading. To qualify, a course must address an industry skills shortage, must not be an academic degree course, and must meet SWDA's Adult Educator Qualifications Requirements.": "具備明確學習成果、為就業或技能提升而建構的可考核課程。要符合資格，課程必須針對業界技能短缺，不得為學術學位課程，並須符合 SWDA 的成人教育工作者資格要求。",
  "Examinable programmes accredited under the Workforce Skills Qualifications framework, mapped to the Skills Framework and eligible for Tier 2 funding. Since 1 May 2026, new courses sit within the sharpened WSQ 2.0 scope described below.": "依勞動力技能資格框架認證、對應技能框架並符合第二層級資助資格的可考核課程。自 2026 年 5 月 1 日起，新課程納入下述更為聚焦的 WSQ 2.0 範疇之內。",
  "Explain it to someone out loud.": "大聲講給別人聽。",
