  "Fail": "不通過",
  "Failure to undergo TPQA when requested, failure to submit by the stipulated deadline, or failure to obtain the minimum quality grade leads to termination of Registered Training Provider status, of SWDA funding, and of eligibility for SkillsFuture Credit. A terminated training provider may only reapply after twelve months, and the list of terminated providers is published on TPGateway.": "受要求時未接受 TPQA、未於規定期限前提交，或未取得最低品質評級，將導致註冊培訓機構資格、SWDA 資助，以及 SkillsFuture Credit 資格一併終止。遭終止的培訓機構須於十二個月後方可重新申請，而遭終止機構的名單會公佈於 TPGateway。",
