  "For ATOs already trading. The administrative back office of an ATO is heavier than most organisations expect, and we run it on a retainer or per-project basis.": "適用於已在營運的 ATO。ATO 的行政後勤，比多數機構所預期的更為繁重，我們以按月聘用或按專案方式代為執行。",
  "For TPQA, roughly two months to prepare and submit your documents, with the one-day onsite visit about a month after that. It sounds generous. It is not, if the evidence has to be created rather than collected. The comfortable position is to be ready before the letter exists.": "就 TPQA 而言，大約需要兩個月準備並提交文件，實地訪視約在其後一個月進行。這聽來寬裕，實則不然，尤其當佐證須從頭創建、而非現成蒐集之時。理想的處境，是在信函尚未存在之前便已準備就緒。",
  "For a training organisation, a course earns nothing until it runs, and it runs only when it fills. Every piece we make is built to move a prospective learner one step closer to enrolment, and to turn that enrolment into revenue the business can actually count on.": "對培訓機構而言，課程在開辦之前分文不賺，而唯有滿額才會開辦。我們製作的每一件作品，都旨在讓潛在學員向報名再靠近一步，並將該筆報名轉化為企業真正能倚靠的營收。",
  "For courses built from the relevant Skills Framework and offered in WSQ or non-WSQ form. The sector's Course Endorsement Body must endorse the proposal before any course application is submitted, and it may request further information before it does. Endorsement is not a guarantee of funding. SWDA makes the final eligibility assessment, audits the application as part of it, and funds an approved course at the 50 or 70 percent support level.": "適用於依相關技能框架建構、並以 WSQ 或非 WSQ 形式開辦的課程。在任何課程申請提交之前，該產業的課程認可機構必須認可該建議書，且在認可之前可要求補充資料。認可並不保證資助。SWDA 作出最終資格評估、將申請的稽核納入其中，並以 50% 或 70% 的支持水準資助獲批課程。",
  "For courses built on skills from the directory above. No endorsement from a Course Endorsement Body or sector agency is required, and at least half the skills the course delivers must appear on the CASL.": "適用於依上述名冊中的技能建構的課程。無需課程認可機構或產業機構的認可，且課程所傳授的技能中，至少須有半數出現在 CASL 上。",
  "For organisations entering the Training and Adult Education sector for the first time. We sit with you from registration through to your first cohort, preparing each submission the way SWDA expects.": "適用於初次踏入培訓與成人教育領域的機構。我們自註冊起，陪伴您直到首屆班次，並按 SWDA 期望的方式編製每一份提交文件。",
  "For training providers operating outside the SWDA framework who now need approved status to access SWDA funding, sectoral commissions, or government tenders.": "適用於在 SWDA 框架之外營運、如今需要取得認可資格以取用 SWDA 資助、產業委辦或政府標案的培訓機構。",
