  "Gladly, and many clients prefer it. On a monthly retainer we manage the TPGateway submissions, the certificate issuance, the audit-evidence folder and the trainer administration. You keep the classroom, the learners and the standing in the sector, which no consultant can hold for you.": "樂意之至，而許多客戶正偏好如此。在按月聘用之下，我們代為處理 TPGateway 提交、證書核發、稽核佐證檔案與培訓師行政事務。您則保有課堂、學員，以及在業界的地位，這些是任何顧問都無法為您持有的。",
