  "He serves as General Manager of 1ST Aid and Healthcare Pte. Ltd. and leads 2birds, an independent curriculum-development and advisory practice. His career has spanned the Singapore Productivity Centre, the Institute of Singapore Chartered Accountants and Adept Academy. At SGPC he developed courses including the Fair Tenancy Industry Committee programme, which": "他擔任 1ST Aid and Healthcare Pte. Ltd. 的總經理，並主理 2birds，一家獨立的課程開發與顧問事務所。他的職涯歷經 Singapore Productivity Centre、Institute of Singapore Chartered Accountants 與 Adept Academy。在 SGPC，他開發了多門課程，包括 Fair Tenancy Industry Committee 計劃，該計劃",
  "He works within SWDA frameworks including WSQ and CASL, and has led training delivery and courseware development for the Singapore Furniture Industries Council Institute, Xprienz, Carrie Academy International, Focus Learning Centre, QD Academy, Addison Institute and HY M&E Consultancy, across artificial intelligence, healthcare, human resources, legal, leadership, food safety, built environment, data science, supply chain and digital analytics.": "他在包括 WSQ 與 CASL 在內的 SWDA 框架內工作，並曾為 Singapore Furniture Industries Council Institute、Xprienz、Carrie Academy International、Focus Learning Centre、QD Academy、Addison Institute 與 HY M&E Consultancy 主理培訓交付與課程教材開發，橫跨人工智慧、醫療保健、人力資源、法律、領導力、食品安全、建築環境、資料科學、供應鏈與數位分析等領域。",
