  "Identity systems and brand guidelines": "識別系統與品牌指引",
  "If a course should not be built, or a project is not ours to take, we say so at the first conversation. Where we can, we point you to someone better placed.": "若一門課程不應建構，或一個專案不宜由我們承接，我們會在首次洽談時如實相告。在能力所及之處，我們會為您引薦更合適的人選。",
  "If the list above looks daunting, that is by design.": "若上述清單看來令人卻步，那正是刻意為之。",
  "If you have read this far, the proposal is simple. Send us a note, in plain words, about the work you have in mind. We will reply within two working days, in the same plain manner.": "若您已讀到此處，提議其實很簡單。以平實的文字，將您構想中的工作寫下寄來。我們會在兩個工作天內，以同樣平實的方式回覆。",
  "If you operate as a registered training provider, or intend to become one, three things will decide whether the business holds. Approval decides whether you have a product at all. A course the Skills and Workforce Development Agency (SWDA), formerly SkillsFuture Singapore (SSG), has not endorsed carries no subsidy, and few learners will be willing to pay for the full fee. Curriculum decides what you then have to build. Once approval is granted, you are bound to the course you described, and the materials and assessments must answer to it. Audit decides whether you keep what you have. A provider whose records diverge from its submissions can forfeit the approval it worked to obtain.": "若您經營一家註冊培訓機構，或有意成為其一，有三件事將決定這門生意能否立穩。審批決定您究竟是否擁有一項產品。一門未經技能與勞動力發展局（SWDA，前身為 SkillsFuture Singapore（SSG））認可的課程，不帶任何補貼，而鮮少有學員願意支付全額費用。課程決定您接下來必須建構什麼。審批一經核予，您便受制於自己所描述的那門課程，而教材與評量都必須對其負責。稽核決定您能否保住既有的一切。一家紀錄與其提交內容有所出入的機構，可能會喪失它辛苦爭取而來的審批。",
  "If you skip the manual, it is because…": "如果你跳過說明書不看，那是因為……",
  "Important answers": "重要解答",
  "Improvement plan drafting": "改善計劃草擬",
  "In November 2025, SWDA held its annual TPQA outreach with training providers from across the sector. Keith was invited to speak on best practices in courseware development and pre-audit preparation.": "2025 年 11 月，SWDA 與業界各方培訓機構舉辦其年度 TPQA 推廣活動。Keith 獲邀就課程教材開發與稽核前準備的最佳實務發表演說。",
  "In a museum, you get the most from…": "在博物館裡，你收穫最多的是……",
