  "May not be registered to the TAEPP framework. From 1 April 2026, AEs who wish to deliver SWDA-supported training must be on the National Adult Educator Registry.": "未必登記於 TAEPP 框架。自 2026 年 4 月 1 日起，凡欲交付 SWDA 支援培訓的 AE，都必須列於全國成人教育工作者名冊之上。",
  "May we apply your accreditations to work prepared elsewhere?": "我們可以將你們的認證套用於他處編製的作品嗎？",
  "Media": "媒體",
  "Meet the community": "認識這個社群",
  "Meetings are by appointment, at our office, your premises or a venue of your convenience.": "會面採預約制，可於本公司辦公室、貴方處所，或任何您方便的地點進行。",
  "Member, Singapore Human Resources Institute": "Singapore 人力資源學會會員",
  "Membership of Singapore's professional body for human resource practitioners.": "Singapore 人力資源從業者專業團體的會員資格。",
  "Mind maps and colour-coded notes.": "心智圖和用顏色標記的筆記。",
