  "Mobile · +65 8595 3945": "手機 · +65 8595 3945",
  "Mode of delivery and assessment write-up": "交付模式與評量說明",
  "Monday to Friday · 9am to 6pm": "週一至週五 · 上午 9 時至下午 6 時",
  "Monday to Friday, 9am to 6pm, excluding public holidays.": "週一至週五，上午 9 時至下午 6 時，公眾假期除外。",
  "Months of paperwork, read in full before it is sent.": "數月的文書作業，在送出之前逐字讀畢。",
  "Most courses reach submission in six to ten weeks, depending on the funding route and how quickly we can sit with your subject-matter expert. SWDA's own review then takes its course. The proposal you sign names the schedule, and we keep to it.": "多數課程於六至十週內達到提交階段，視資助途徑，以及我們能多快與您的主題專家共同商討而定。其後便進入 SWDA 本身的審查。您簽署的建議書會載明時程，而我們會恪守。",
  "Most enquiries fall into one of three forms. We fit the form to the project, not the project to the form.": "多數查詢可歸為三種形式。我們讓形式契合專案，而非讓專案遷就形式。",
  "Most new entrants underestimate the administrative cadence of a trading ATO. The funded course requires post-cohort filings within prescribed windows. The renewal cycle requires evidence accumulated over the preceding twelve months. The Adult Educator Registry requires upkeep as practitioners come and go. None of it is difficult work, but none of it forgives a lapse.": "多數新進者都低估了一家營運中 ATO 的行政節奏。獲資助的課程須於規定期限內完成班次結束後的申報。續期週期須累積前十二個月的佐證。成人教育工作者名冊須隨著實務工作者的來去而持續維護。這些工作無一艱難，卻也無一容得疏漏。",
  "Most of our work begins with one course.": "我們的工作，大多始於一門課程。",
  "Mostly hands-on practice.": "大部分時間都在動手實作。",
  "Multimodal, led by Aural": "多模態，以聽覺為主導",
  "Multimodal, led by Kinaesthetic": "多模態，以動覺為主導",
  "Multimodal, led by Read / write": "多模態，以讀寫為主導",
  "Multimodal, led by Visual": "多模態，以視覺為主導",
  "NOA": "NOA",
  "Name": "姓名",
  "Name your organisation": "填寫您的機構名稱",
  "National AE Registry": "全國 AE 名冊",
  "National Parks Board (NParks)": "National Parks Board (NParks)",
  "National Youth Council / OAE Council": "National Youth Council / OAE Council",
  "Neil Fleming's 1987 model of four learning preferences, by seeing, by hearing, by reading and writing, and by doing. It shapes how we build courseware.": "Neil Fleming 於 1987 年提出的四種學習偏好模型：透過看、透過聽、透過讀寫，以及透過實作。它形塑了我們建構課程教材的方式。",
  "New courses to submit, funding to maintain, audits to prepare for, and classes to fill. We assist with all of it, every day.": "有新課程要提交、有資助要維繫、有稽核要準備，也有班次要招滿。這一切，我們每天都在協助。",
  "New to the sector's language? Every abbreviation on this site is spelt out in": "初次接觸業界的用語？本網站上的每一個縮寫，皆詳解於",
  "No document leaves the firm on one person's judgement alone. Every course, submission and audit response is read twice before anyone outside the firm sees it.": "沒有任何文件僅憑一人的判斷便離開本公司。每一門課程、每一份提交文件與稽核回應，在對外之前都經過兩次審閱。",
  "No one way of teaching fits everyone.": "沒有單一的教學方式能適合所有人。",
  "No, and you should be wary of anyone who says otherwise. The grade rests with SWDA's assessors alone. What we can do, and have done, is close every gap the checklist can find, put the evidence in the order assessors expect, and rehearse your team for the interviews. The two providers we have walked through TPQA both returned Grade 1.": "不能，而且您應對任何聲稱能保證的人有所警惕。評級全然取決於 SWDA 的評估員。我們能做、且已經做到的，是彌合檢核表所能找出的每一處缺口，將佐證按評估員期望的順序排列，並為您的團隊排練訪談。經我們陪伴走過 TPQA 的兩家培訓機構，皆取得第一級。",
