  "People take in new material differently. Some understand a diagram at a glance. Some need to talk an idea through. Some want the manual, and some just want to try it with their own hands. A course built for only one kind of learner quietly leaves the others behind.": "人們吸收新知的方式各不相同。有些人看一眼圖表便能領會。有些人需要把想法談過一遍。有些人想要一本手冊，有些人則只想親手試一試。一門只為單一類型學員而建構的課程，會悄然將其餘的人拋在身後。",
