  "Pin skills to a working list as you browse, then send it across. We reply with a frank assessment of marketability and the right funding route, within two working days.": "瀏覽時，將感興趣的技能釘選至一份工作清單，再一併寄來。我們會就其市場性與合適的資助途徑，給出坦誠的評估，並於兩個工作天內回覆。",
  "PixPlaySG is our creative collaborator in front of the lens. Their focus is personal branding video for training providers, the kind that gives an ATO and its principal trainers the recognition they have earned. We plan it, PixPlaySG films it, and the provider publishes it, the way the guideline requires.": "PixPlaySG 是我們在鏡頭前的創意合作夥伴。他們專注於為培訓機構製作個人品牌影片，正是那種能讓一家 ATO 及其主要培訓師獲得應得肯定的作品。我們負責策劃，PixPlaySG 負責拍攝，培訓機構再依指引所要求的方式發佈。",
