  "Revenue per learner, gross margin per course, enterprise repeat rate, and three-year retention of the AE roster. These are the metrics that determine whether the business survives the next change in funding.": "每位學員的營收、每門課程的毛利率、企業回頭率，以及 AE 名冊的三年留任率。這些指標，決定了這門生意能否挺過下一次資助的變動。",
  "Rich in talk and live questions.": "充滿講授和現場提問。",
