  "SWDA": "SWDA",
  "SWDA Audit Matters": "SWDA 稽核事務",
  "SWDA allows a review, requested within ten working days of the outcome, at a fee of $3,052 including GST, and only on narrow grounds, a failure of procedure, or findings that contradict the evidence examined. We assist you in judging honestly whether those grounds exist, and we draft the request if they do.": "SWDA 容許提出複審，須於結果公佈後十個工作天內提出，費用為 $3,052（含 GST），且僅限於狹義的理由，即程序上的失誤，或與所審佐證相矛盾的裁定。我們協助您坦誠判斷此等理由是否存在，若存在，則代為草擬申請。",
  "SWDA audit": "SWDA 稽核",
  "SWDA audits the training providers it funds, and a poor result can end your funding. We get your documents, your team and your day-to-day operation ready, months before the letter arrives.": "SWDA 會稽核其資助的培訓機構，而不佳的結果可能終止您的資助。我們會在信函到來的數月之前，備妥您的文件、您的團隊與您的日常營運。",
  "SWDA checks its funded training providers in two ways. The first is the Training Provider Quality Assessment (TPQA), a review of your whole organisation, from how you handle learner feedback to how your board signs off on policy. The grade decides whether you keep full funding, partial funding, or lose your registered status altogether.": "SWDA 以兩種方式查核其所資助的培訓機構。第一種是培訓機構品質評估（TPQA），對您整個機構進行審視，從您如何處理學員回饋，到您的董事會如何簽核政策。評級決定您能保有全額資助、部分資助，抑或徹底喪失註冊資格。",
  "SWDA expects at least a year of regular training activity, with at least one course in every quarter, supported by structured evidence. If you are not there yet, that is not the end of the conversation. We plan the runway with you, what to run, how to document it, and when the application becomes viable.": "SWDA 期望至少一年的常態培訓活動，每一季至少一門課程，並有結構化的佐證支持。若您尚未達標，對話並不會就此結束。我們會與您一同規劃前置期：該辦什麼、如何記錄，以及何時申請方才可行。",
  "SWDA measures a training provider across three criteria and twelve items. Each item, done well, returns something measurable to the business, whether in learner retention, governance posture or enterprise standing. Score yourself below, or read the market best practice for each item.": "SWDA 就三項準則與十二個項目衡量一家培訓機構。每一個項目若做得好，都會為企業帶回可衡量的回報，無論是在學員留存、治理姿態，抑或企業聲望之上。您可在下方為自己評分，或閱讀每一個項目的市場最佳實務。",
  "SWDA notifies the provider, and the documents listed in the notification are furnished, including the following.": "SWDA 通知培訓機構，通知中所列的文件須予提供，包括以下各項。",
  "SWDA's Skills Demand for the Future Economy report organises Singapore's sectoral demand around three priority economies. Our community currently works within parts of each, and grows carefully, by invitation.": "SWDA 的《未來經濟技能需求》報告，將 Singapore 的產業需求圍繞三大優先經濟體加以組織。我們的社群目前在其中各領域的部分範疇內運作，並以邀約制審慎成長。",
  "SWDA's check of the courseware itself, as it is actually used in delivery. It sits alongside TPQA and is usually a document review.": "SWDA 對課程教材本身的查核，即其實際用於交付時的樣態。它與 TPQA 並行，且通常是文件審查。",
  "SWDA's online portal for training providers. Registration, course submissions, funding claims and audit correspondence all pass through it.": "SWDA 供培訓機構使用的線上入口平台。註冊、課程提交、資助申領與稽核往來，皆經由此平台。",
  "SWDA's quality assessment of a funded training provider as a whole. The grade decides whether the provider keeps its funding.": "SWDA 對一家獲資助培訓機構整體的品質評估。評級決定該機構能否保有其資助。",
  "SWDA's sector-by-sector map of job roles and the skills they require. WSQ courses are mapped to it.": "SWDA 逐一產業繪製的職務角色及其所需技能的對照圖。WSQ 課程即對應於此。",
  "SWDA's survey of learners after funded training. Weak scores raise the chance of a course being selected for review.": "SWDA 於獲資助培訓後對學員進行的調查。分數偏弱會提高一門課程被選中受審的機率。",
