  "Sectors built around sustainability, decarbonisation and the built environment. The framework here is younger, and our network of SMEs in this area is still being assembled.": "圍繞可持續發展、脫碳與建築環境而建構的產業。此處的框架較為年輕，而我們在此領域的 SME 網絡仍在組建之中。",
  "Sectors driving the transition to data, cloud and AI. Skills are listed under the Course Approval Skills List (CASL) and qualify for the higher SWDA funding tier where eligible.": "驅動向資料、雲端與 AI 轉型的產業。相關技能列於課程審批技能清單（CASL）之下，並在符合條件時取得較高的 SWDA 資助層級。",
  "Sectors that serve a growing and ageing population. Demand is steady and SWDA funding well-established for both WSQ and non-WSQ certifiable courses.": "服務於日益增長且高齡化人口的產業。無論 WSQ 或非 WSQ 可認證課程，需求皆穩定，且 SWDA 資助已相當成熟。",
