  "Short, employment-relevant programmes that sit outside the WSQ framework but address an identified industry skills need, for company-sponsored or self-sponsored learners.": "篇幅短、與就業相關的課程，落在 WSQ 框架之外，卻切合已識別的業界技能需求，供企業贊助或自費學員修讀。",
  "Show you on the real thing.": "拿實物做給你看。",
  "Since 1 April 2026, every adult educator who trains or assesses on an SWDA-funded certifiable course must meet the qualifications threshold that has long applied to WSQ. The threshold has two parts.": "自 2026 年 4 月 1 日起，凡在 SWDA 資助的可認證課程上授課或評量的成人教育工作者，都必須符合長期以來適用於 WSQ 的資格門檻。該門檻分為兩部分。",
