  "Singapore's consumption tax. We are not GST-registered, so no GST is charged on our professional fees.": "Singapore 的消費稅。我們並未登記 GST，因此我們的專業費用不收取 GST。",
  "Singapore's data protection law, which governs how we collect and hold personal data. Our Privacy Policy sets out the detail.": "Singapore 的資料保護法，規範我們如何蒐集與保存個人資料。詳情載於我們的隱私政策。",
  "Singapore's national credentialing system for workforce skills. WSQ courses are competency-based, examinable, and eligible for the higher tier of SWDA funding.": "Singapore 的全國勞動力技能認證體系。WSQ 課程以能力為本、可考核，並符合較高層級 SWDA 資助的資格。",
  "Singapore's registrar of companies. A training provider must first exist as a legal entity registered here, or with the Registry of Societies.": "Singapore 的公司註冊機關。培訓機構必須先以在此註冊、或向社團註冊局註冊的法律實體形式存在。",
  "Six places where the choice of practitioner matters, in handling rather than in slogans.": "六個實務工作者的選擇至關重要之處，體現於處理手法，而非口號。",
  "Sketching it out where you can see it.": "把它畫出來，擺在眼前看。",
  "Skills Framework": "技能框架",
  "Skills and Workforce Development Agency": "技能與勞動力發展局",
  "Skills and Workforce Development Agency (SWDA)": "技能與勞動力發展局（SWDA）",
  "Skills and Workforce Development Agency (SWDA) invited us to speak at its 2025 outreach on strengthening training quality through sound adult educator systems.": "技能與勞動力發展局（SWDA）邀請我們於其 2025 年推廣活動中發表演說，主題為透過健全的成人教育工作者體系提升培訓品質。",
  "Skills and Workforce Development Agency's 2025 guideline is clear. Under Information Memorandum QMD/2025/5, a registered training provider may not engage, request or procure any outside party to promote, advertise or market its courses. The public face of the courses stays with the provider.": "技能與勞動力發展局的 2025 年指引十分明確。根據資訊備忘錄 QMD/2025/5，註冊培訓機構不得聘用、要求或委辦任何外部方推廣、宣傳或行銷其課程。課程的公開門面，須由培訓機構自身持有。",
  "SkillsFuture Singapore": "SkillsFuture Singapore",
  "Skip to content": "跳至內容",
  "Slides and Learner Guide": "投影片與學員指南",
  "Small, senior, and answerable.": "精簡、資深，且負責到底。",
  "So every course we build offers more than one route to the same understanding. A learner can meet the material in the way that suits them, and a trainer never has to teach to the middle and hope the rest keep up.": "因此我們建構的每一門課程，都提供不止一條通往同一理解的途徑。學員能以最適合自己的方式接觸教材，而培訓師也永遠不必只為中段程度者授課，再寄望其餘的人能跟上。",
  "So we build in narration, discussion and spoken walk-throughs, so the material can be heard as readily as it is read.": "所以我們加入旁白、討論和口頭的逐步講解，讓教材既能讀，也一樣能聽。",
  "So we build practice, worked examples and hands-on tasks into the course, so the learning happens by doing.": "所以我們把練習、範例和動手的任務融入課程，讓學習在實踐中發生。",
  "So we hold ourselves to a simple promise. Dream as big as you like, and our job is to build the course that can actually take you there. A course should lift people up, never screen them out, and the height a learner reaches should be set by their own effort, never by carelessly made material.": "因此我們以一個簡單的承諾自守。無論您的夢想多麼宏大，我們的職責就是建構一門真正能載您抵達彼方的課程。一門課程應當托舉人向上，而非將人篩落，而學員所能攀抵的高度，理應由他們自身的努力決定，絕不由草率製成的教材決定。",
  "So we lead with diagrams, flow and clear layout, and let the structure of a course be visible at a glance.": "所以我們以圖表、流程和清晰的排版開路，讓一門課程的結構一眼就能看清。",
  "So we write courseware in plain, well-ordered prose, with notes, summaries and definitions that reward a careful reader.": "所以我們用平實、條理分明的文字來編寫課程教材，配上筆記、摘要和定義，讓用心的讀者讀有所得。",
