  "Team delivery means faster turnaround, supported by legal training that lets us justify our pedagogical outcomes to SWDA auditors.": "團隊交付意味著更快的周轉，並以法律專業訓練為後盾，使我們得以向 SWDA 稽核員闡明我們教學成效的正當理據。",
  "Technical Skills and Competencies": "專業技能與能力",
  "Telephone · optional": "電話 · 選填",
  "Tell them, turn by turn.": "一個路口一個路口地講給他聽。",
  "Tell us the course you have in mind, and we will tell you the form, the funding route and the fee, candidly, within two working days.": "告訴我們您構想中的課程，我們會坦誠告知其形式、資助途徑與費用，並於兩個工作天內回覆。",
  "Tell us what the project looks like.": "告訴我們這個專案的樣貌。",
  "Tell us what you want to build. We will tell you honestly whether it is worth building, which SWDA funding route fits it, and roughly what it would cost. There is no charge and no obligation.": "告訴我們您想建構什麼。我們會坦誠告知它是否值得建構、哪一條 SWDA 資助途徑適合它，以及大致的費用。無需付費，亦無任何義務。",
  "Tell us where you are starting from, and we will tell you candidly what the road to a first cohort looks like.": "告訴我們您的起點，我們會坦誠告知，通往首屆班次的道路是何模樣。",
  "Ten to sixteen weeks, done properly the first time.": "十至十六週，一次就做到位。",
  "Terms of Engagement": "委聘條款",
  "Terms of engagement": "委聘條款",
  "Thailand · ภาษาไทย": "泰國 · ภาษาไทย",
  "That is the point of how we build. Every assessment traces back to the competency map, every document carries a version line, and the whole set is arranged the way the Course Quality Check reads it. Auditors are calmer when the paperwork already speaks their language.": "這正是我們建構方式的用意所在。每一項評量都能回溯至能力對照表，每一份文件都帶有版本註記，整套資料皆按課程品質查核的閱讀方式排列。當文書已說著稽核人員的語言，他們自然更為安心。",
  "That is the working relationship we offer. You bring the dream, a new academy, a new course, a business that teaches what you know. We fly in front, taking the hardest air, the regulations, the paperwork, the audits, so you arrive with strength to spare. And we stay in formation until the work is safely down. We do not leave early.": "這正是我們所提供的合作關係。您帶來夢想：一所新的學院、一門新的課程、一門教授您所長的事業。我們飛在前方，承受最艱難的氣流：法規、文書、稽核，好讓您抵達時仍有餘力。而我們會保持編隊，直到工作安然著陸。我們不會提前離去。",
  "The \"How 2birds assists\" notes describe the typical role of the firm and are in every case subject to a separate engagement letter. Where this directory and the official SWDA framework differ, the official framework, in its current form, shall prevail.": "「2birds 如何協助」的說明，描述的是本公司的典型角色，且在任何情況下均以另行簽訂的委聘書為準。若本名冊與 SWDA 官方框架有所出入，概以現行官方框架為準。",
  "The \"industry\" and \"intended participants\" fields, together with all counts, rankings and market observations derived from them, represent the editorial interpretation of 2birds and are provided solely as an aid to navigation. They carry no regulatory significance, are not SWDA classifications, and must not be relied upon as such. The appearance of a skill in this directory does not signify that a course is, or will be, eligible for funding or approved by SWDA, such approval residing at all times in the sole and absolute discretion of SWDA, nor does it constitute an endorsement or recommendation by 2birds. Nothing in this directory constitutes legal, financial, regulatory or other professional advice.": "「產業」與「預期學員」欄位，連同由其衍生的所有計數、排名與市場觀察，均代表 2birds 的編輯詮釋，僅作為導覽輔助之用。它們不具任何監管意義，並非 SWDA 的分類，亦不得據以倚賴。某項技能出現於本名冊之中，並不表示某門課程現在或將來符合資助資格、或獲 SWDA 批准，此等批准始終全然繫於 SWDA 獨有且絕對的裁量權，亦不構成 2birds 的背書或推薦。本名冊中的任何內容，均不構成法律、財務、監管或其他專業建議。",
  "The 2 in 2birds is deliberate. Two sets of eyes on every page, two parties in every promise.": "2birds 中的「2」別具深意：每一頁都有兩雙眼睛審視，每一份承諾都有兩方共守。",
