  "Trainers and SMEs Sourcing": "培訓師與 SME 物色",
  "Trainers and subject-matter experts join our community and are matched to real courses, with no placement fee taken from anyone.": "培訓師與主題專家加入我們的社群，並獲配對至真實的課程，我們不向任何人收取媒合費。",
  "Training Outcomes": "培訓成效",
  "Training Partners Gateway": "培訓夥伴閘道",
  "Training Provider Quality Assessment": "培訓機構品質評估",
  "Training Quality and Outcomes Measurement": "培訓品質與成效評量",
  "Training Track Record": "培訓往績",
  "Training and Adult Education": "培訓與成人教育",
  "Training and Adult Education Professionalisation Pathway": "培訓與成人教育專業化路徑",
  "Training organisation": "培訓機構",
  "Training provider": "培訓機構",
  "Training providers and their paperwork": "培訓機構及其文書作業",
  "Training providers come to us the way one goes to a good craftsman. The work is measured precisely, tailored closely, and made to last. We take on a limited number of projects each quarter, and we give each one the whole of our attention.": "培訓機構來到我們身邊，一如人們求助於一位好工匠。工作經過精準的丈量、貼身的裁製，並以歷久耐用為念而製成。我們每季僅承接有限數量的專案，並將全副心神傾注於每一個。",
  "Tripartite Alliance for Fair and Progressive Employment Practices": "公平與進步僱傭實務三方聯盟",
  "Trust and clarity turn interest into sign-ups. A filled cohort means SWDA funding drawn down, fees collected, and trainers kept in steady work.": "信任與清晰，將興趣化為報名。一屆滿額的班次，意味著 SWDA 資助得以動支、學費得以收取，培訓師也得以持續有工可做。",
  "Try it yourself": "親自試試",
  "Trying things until one works.": "一樣樣試，直到試通為止。",
  "Tutor Kiki": "Tutor Kiki",
  "Tutor KikiBehance ↗": "Tutor KikiBehance ↗",
  "Twenty minutes, by phone or by email. We will tell you, candidly, whether the work is something we should take on, and what it would cost.": "二十分鐘，透過電話或電郵。我們會坦誠告知，這項工作是否為我們應當承接的，以及費用如何。",
  "Twenty-five questions · find how you learn ↓": "二十五道問題 · 探尋你的學習之道 ↓",
  "Two audits. One preparation.": "兩項稽核。一套準備。",
  "Two birds watch in turns. While one feeds, the other watches the horizon, so nothing arrives unseen.": "兩隻鳥輪流守望。當一隻進食時，另一隻凝視地平線，使一切來臨皆無所遁形。",
  "Two readers on every page": "每一頁都有兩位審閱者",
  "Two recent details matter. Providers holding a four-year EduTrust certification may qualify for TPQA on a reduced scope. And the item covering the management of marketing activities was updated with effect from 1 December 2025, which is one reason our": "近期有兩項細節值得留意。持有四年期 EduTrust 認證的機構，可能符合以縮減範圍接受 TPQA 的資格。此外，關於行銷活動管理的項目，自 2025 年 12 月 1 日起更新生效，這正是我們",
  "Two sets of eyes read every page before it leaves the firm. What one of us might miss, the other catches, well before any auditor does.": "每一頁在離開本公司之前，都經兩雙眼睛審閱。一人可能疏漏之處，另一人會及時察覺，遠早於任何稽核人員。",
  "Two training providers, two Grade 1 outcomes.": "兩家培訓機構，兩個第一級結果。",
  "Typically not offered, or charged separately.": "通常不予提供，或另行收費。",
  "UEN": "UEN",
  "Unavailable": "無法提供",
  "Under SWDA Circular RD/2023/1, in force from 22 November 2023, the assessment produces one of three grades, and each carries a different consequence for the training provider's funding eligibility.": "根據自 2023 年 11 月 22 日起生效的 SWDA 通函 RD/2023/1，評估會產生三種評級之一，而每一種對培訓機構的資助資格皆帶來不同的後果。",
  "Under SWDA memorandum SIPD/2026/2, the WSQ 2.0 scope took effect on 1 May 2026 and the moratorium on new courses lifted with it. The framework now rewards two things, training tied to regulatory and safety standards, and credentials that carry across employers.": "根據 SWDA 備忘錄 SIPD/2026/2，WSQ 2.0 範疇自 2026 年 5 月 1 日起生效，新課程的暫緩令亦隨之解除。此框架如今著重獎勵兩件事：與法規及安全標準相繫的培訓，以及能跨越不同雇主通用的資歷。",
  "Unique Entity Number": "唯一實體編號",
  "V · CASL Directory": "V · CASL 名冊",
  "V · Deliverables": "V · 交付項目",
  "V · How we teach": "V · 我們如何教學",
  "V · OR directory": "V · OR 註冊",
  "V · The return": "V · 回報",
